Z||000011||skitime||07-18-2001||11:59 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Adrift:<BR><B>skitime - i may have already asked this but what rims are those? How big are they (16"?)<BR>how much did they Cost?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They are Prime wheels model 705 and I paid $149 each.  They are chrome and are not just polished aluminum. I have 205/50/17 on the front and 235/45/17 on the rear.  I got them from  <A HREF="http://www.cruisin-gold.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cruisin-gold.com/</A>   I see that are out of these right now.  I got the wheels with the tires already mounted and included lugs and locks. This pic is four lug but of course five lug is available too.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/705-1-2_1.jpg">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 07-19-2001).]||||reg||1
