Z||000034||Old Lar||07-20-2001||01:39 PM||||Probably $15K on my 88 not including the cost of the car. 2 engines, one transmission, one paint job, new suspension, wheels tires, headliner, headlight motor, Borla exhaust, cat, bushings, brakes plus repairing all the stuff before I said out with the old and in with the new.  I wish I was a mechanic.  It still need more.||||reg||9
