Z||000036||Voytek||07-20-2001||06:15 PM||||My car: '87 GT:<BR>Let's see... I've had the car for 4 years.  Let me add up only the ones I actually remember (in CDN $):<BR>$2,850.00 car<BR>$1,275.00 clutch<BR>$650.00 paint job (did prep work myself)<BR>$3,230.00 engine rebuild<BR>$200.00 Delco CD player<BR>$290.00 A/C compressor<BR>$70.00 receiver/drier<BR>$221.00 timing cover gasket<BR>$54.00 (2) water pumps<BR>$90.00 slave cylinder<BR>$80.00 new clutch line<BR>$66.00 TPS<BR>$36.00 oxygen sensor<BR>$65.00 IAC<BR>$123.00 trunk gasket<BR>$900.00 Sprint manifolds<BR>$170.00 ball joints (done twice)<BR>$120.00 two alignments<BR>TOTAL:  $10,490.00<BR>This does not include MANY MANY misc. small parts, diagnostics, etc.etc.  Of about HALF of the work above was done by me.<P><BR>Wow, that puts things in perspective...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
