Z||000038||RoadRocket||07-20-2001||07:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fformula88:<BR><B>Another question... who is also supporting another car?  My Fiero isn't my daily driver, so I am putting money into two vehicles.  Somehow, they both always need oil changes, tires, and other things at the same time.  They must conspire against me!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I got ya beat Formula88  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>My Fiero sat for four years. I just resurrected it, six months ago. Ever since then, I have had to do extensive repairs on both my cars.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>In fact, both are in the shop right now, even as I type. <P>That'll teach me!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Ed Dana<BR>88 Coupe.||||reg||1
