Z||000040||Veronica's V6 GT||07-20-2001||09:45 PM||||Hey guys, I hate to tell you this but I've spent about $1500 since I've bought the car.<BR>That's including tires, restoring the seats to original, upper A-arm repairs, sub-woofer,radio and new speaker, and many other little engine repairs and fixer uppers from the yards (and many thanks to Pondski also).  But the best thing of all is I've got one hell of a Fiero mechanic living with me and he's taught me alot about how to fix it myself too(Thanks alot skitime).  It's all been money well spent, my car handles beautifully, runs great and I enjoy everytime that I drive it.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Veronica's V6 GT (edited 07-20-2001).]||||reg||1
